invariant: INV-56
file: src/mlkem_poly.c
catches: mlkem_test_two_ranks
reason: in an object that runs both ranks, mlk_poly_compress_du packs u
  in 11 bits at rank 3 and in 10 bits at rank 4. An object of one rank
  compiles one width and runs it whatever the test reads, so only the
  two-rank binaries see it: the ML-KEM-768 known answers at rank 3 get
  a ciphertext of the wrong width and fail.

